     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi folks,<div>The summer field season is upon us and that unfortunately means less time spent with R and more time spent in the field (for me).  I won&#39;t be around the next few Tuesdays to host our weekly worksession, but please stay tuned for a poll/email in the next week or so to vote on potential new times for the summer. </div><div><br></div><div>Also, for the folks using `dplyr`, a new version has been released. There are some new and nice programming updates built into it...check out a short demo on the dplyr website: <a href=\"http://dplyr.tidyverse.org/articles/programming.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dplyr.tidyverse.org/articles/programming.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466884496000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2WcfjtjF-t1S5cwJm7YqXH\">http://dplyr.tidyverse.org/articles/programming.html</a></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Best of luck with whatever you may be working on, inside or outside.</div><div><br></div><div>Adios,<br>Ryan<br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></b></i></font></span><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><font size=\"1\"><i>&quot;When we try to pick out anything by itself, we find it hitched to everything else in the universe.&quot;<b><br>John Muir (My First Summer in the Sierra, 1911)</b></i></font></div><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b>-----------------------------------------------------</b></i></font></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;line-height:19px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><div>Ryan Peek</div><div>PhD Candidate, Graduate Group in Ecology<br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">Center for Watershed Sciences, UC Davis</div></font></span><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><div><b style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148);font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\"><i><a href=\"http://ryanpeek.github.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https: